        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Elisa, the daughter of an ordinary family, has been in prison for ten years for brutally murdering her sister. She believes she doesn’t remember what happened, but her fragmented memories begin to come into focus during meetings with the criminologist Alaoui, who is conducting a study on family homicides. The truth that emerges for Elisa is devastating—a pain that may mark the beginning of redemption.",
          "runtime": 105,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Elisa"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "KR",
        "iso_639_1": "ko",
        "name": "한국어/조선말",
        "english_name": "Korean",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "10년 전 자신의 언니를 살해한 죄로 복역 중인 엘리사. 그동안 엘리사는 자신이 저지른 일에 대해 어떤 이야기도 하지 않았고, 살해의 동기 역시 밝혀지지 않았다. 그러나 한 범죄학자의 조사에 참여하기로 하면서 엘리사의 과거에 얽힌 비밀이 하나씩 드러나기 시작한다.",
          "runtime": 109,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "엘리사"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "PL",
        "iso_639_1": "pl",
        "name": "Polski",
        "english_name": "Polish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Elisa, młoda kobieta z dobrej rodziny, od 10 lat przebywa w więzieniu za brutalne morderstwo siostry. Jej zagmatwane wspomnienia rozjaśniają się, gdy spotyka kryminologa Alaouiego, który prowadzi badania nad przestępstwami rodzinnymi. Prawda, która wychodzi na jaw, jest dla Elisy szokująca. Ból, który być może jest początkiem odkupienia.",
          "runtime": 105,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Elisa"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.nourfilms.com/cinema-independant/laffaire-zanetti/",
          "overview": "Elisa Zanetti a été condamnée pour un crime dont elle dit ne presque rien se rappeler. Dix ans plus tard, le professeur Alaoui, criminologue de renom, rouvre son dossier. Un face-à-face tendu s’engage entre les deux. Peu à peu, les souvenirs enfouis refont surface, et avec eux, une vérité bien plus complexe qu’il n’y paraît. Jusqu’où peut-on aller pour entrer dans l’esprit d’une criminelle ? D’après une histoire vraie.",
          "runtime": 105,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "L'Affaire Zanetti"
        }
      },
